    <Title>Beyond the long argument with the colour blue</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0392","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2017-09-01</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0392","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ếlodie Castellanos talks about a dot, considered at length. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
